          "name": "entity_lookup",
          "canonical_hash": "sha256:ba048756b532ea6443f92f9115d4a4fb1df5132173bde2e15119d6224ae677ee",
          "description": "Look up any business entity by name, CIF/NIF, EU VAT, or LEI. Free callers receive a trace-level identity preview; authenticated callers receive the full paid dossier.",
